[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10625.11, "timestamp": "02:57:05", "text": "所以，我们缺少了德拉格诺瑟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10628.309, "timestamp": "02:57:08", "text": "嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10631.19, "timestamp": "02:57:11", "text": "Chungus。哦，是的。番茄酱是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10633.67, "timestamp": "02:57:13", "text": "那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10637.51, "timestamp": "02:57:17", "text": "皮卡丘的个人资料图片上有番茄酱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10639.11, "timestamp": "02:57:19", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10641.11, "timestamp": "02:57:21", "text": "哦，是的。曾几何时，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10642.95, "timestamp": "02:57:22", "text": "呃，他正在取宝可梦的名字，所以他没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10646.55, "timestamp": "02:57:26", "text": "此后他就改了名字。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10648.15, "timestamp": "02:57:28", "text": "哦，好的。好的，这就是你为什么这么做的原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10649.91, "timestamp": "02:57:29", "text": "男人放屁的起源就在于此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10652.87, "timestamp": "02:57:32", "text": "放屁放出来的？呃，按F键。站在旁边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10656.469, "timestamp": "02:57:36", "text": "我按了F键。不，为什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10659.03, "timestamp": "02:57:39", "text": "别在我面前放屁。我刚才试了一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10660.95, "timestamp": "02:57:40", "text": "你是主人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10663.99, "timestamp": "02:57:43", "text": "哦，拜托。你为什么真的在放屁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10666.79, "timestamp": "02:57:46", "text": "远的？拜托。好的，我要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10669.03, "timestamp": "02:57:49", "text": "减少"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10671.11, "timestamp": "02:57:51", "text": "就像音量一样，因为一切都真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10676.79, "timestamp": "02:57:56", "text": "对我来说很高。 59 59 59 59 当然。当然。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10678.389, "timestamp": "02:57:58", "text": "嗯。"}]